Dialogue: 10,0:01:10.20,0:01:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Whew! What a dazzling beauty!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:37.16,0:01:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Simply stunning!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:39.48,0:01:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{he uses it too often, not gonna sub this}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:43.49,0:01:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:45.36,0:01:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see a thing...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:58.52,0:01:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:59.59,0:02:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to go get my glasses.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:03.88,0:02:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:09.10,0:02:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? She's gone.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:12.68,0:02:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My, oh my.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:15.08,0:02:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:16.08,0:02:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ciao! Ciao, babe! {??? no clue what's that chao/cho - maybe "Ciao!" but that's usually said when parting; maybe a shortening of chou[bijin]?} {Ciao can be used for both hello and goodbye, but using it three times in a row is too retarded to be true, so I'll compromise}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:19.29,0:02:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:20.63,0:02:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hello there.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:21.98,0:02:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:22.25,0:02:22.92,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:23.30,0:02:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You're quite the man. {???}{complimenting his 様子}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:24.63,0:02:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're getting prettier every time I look at you!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:26.84,0:02:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:28.17,0:02:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What a charmer you are. {lit: You're good [with words].}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:30.10,0:02:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsk! Did someone beat me to the punch already?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.72,0:02:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.95,0:02:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.06,0:03:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I can be that handsome too, \Nif I feel like it!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:03.11,0:03:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Go! {I'm tired of translating his koi}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.56,0:03:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies don't even look at me.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.77,0:03:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.64,0:03:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Blazes, husband! Where have you been?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:42.87,0:03:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,T-Taking a walk.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.79,0:03:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,With other women?! {sometihng about uwaki = affair/infidelity}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:44.57,0:03:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, no...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.38,0:03:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My god! Going out drinking every single night at your age!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.40,0:03:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Even at home, my manhood is under attack!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.81,0:04:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, friend. You, in glasses. \NI've got just what you need.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.06,0:04:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Just call this number \Nand they'll let you right in.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.44,0:04:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a true paradise on Earth!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.42,0:04:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This looks interesting...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.97,0:04:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll call at once with this public phone...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.16,0:04:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.10,0:04:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, we need to check if you're not with the police. {?????}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.97,0:04:24.52,Overlap,,0,0,0,,You're good, go ahead.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.52,0:04:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh! Wonderful.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.26,0:04:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now this is what I call debauchery! {the word used here is 酒池肉林, I only know of it because NoraInuG had the same problem as you in a Pollon episode; you could use the more literal "wine fountains and forest of meat" too if you want that ESL flavor}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.70,0:04:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, won't you drink with me, dear sir?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.83,0:04:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Benten, my goddess! {??? assuming he calls her benten = the american cartoon, I mean, Benten (goddess of arts and wisdom)}{no need for it to not be Benten the goddess}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.21,0:04:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this sake too sweet for you?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.08,0:04:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You've such a wonderful chin, \Nit's driving me crazy.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.80,0:04:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.56,0:05:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it really is hopeless for me...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.86,0:05:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.09,0:05:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.88,0:05:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.53,0:05:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.38,0:05:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, lady... Lady!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.97,0:05:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.30,0:05:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that was invigorating.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.39,0:05:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can really die in peace... {souvenir for the underworld}{guess that's a really roundabout way to say she'll have a good memory to bring with her to the underworld}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.06,0:05:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The life of a flower...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.52,0:05:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,sure is short.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.20,0:05:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder, I beg you. {老師 = old master; old teacher}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.19,0:06:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, I know.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.55,0:06:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's this that you want.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.28,0:06:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.52,0:06:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And Asian ginseng—100 grams... {/Korean carrot}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.95,0:06:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And after that...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.07,0:06:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.29,0:06:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The juice of half-a-dozen taro stems, right... {芋茎?}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.42,0:06:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,In you go.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.88,0:06:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And um... Now, steadily, calmly. {????? none of the meanings of zui have anything to do with snakes or poison, I think?}{I think he's just doing that retarded thing all characters do of repeating the same thing a lot of times, in this case not the ingredient but the regular "zui"}{alternatively, it could be pith in the sense of the "essence"(https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/pith#Noun) of the snake, but that's even more far-fetched and unlikely}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.78,0:06:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Squeeze it for several seconds...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.56,0:06:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, an apricot...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.71,0:07:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Just half of it will grant you \Ninfinite vitality. {????? nc what's that keisan, something "surprisingly effective"}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.25,0:08:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My word, this is totally unbearable.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.91,0:08:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All that's left now is to wait for this old hag to croak, and find a better wife for myself. {????? that same keisan, still no clue what to make of it; lit: all that's left is to wait for the end of this guy's lifespan}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.29,0:08:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start with an experiment...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.74,0:09:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, another experiment. {??????? only word I hear is "experiment"}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.98,0:09:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get in the way of others blowing their stack! {to let out; to utter; to produce; to emit; to give forth; to discharge - maybe a double entendre on ejaculation?}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:42.31,0:09:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This means I {\i1}am{\i0} immortal now.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.63,0:09:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the Hermit Village style heart-strengthening technique. {??????}{no idea either}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.74,0:09:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to what happens next.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.95,0:10:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.02,0:10:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? How did this happen?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.96,0:10:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, daughter—he's even unafraid of me! \NGo deal with him, the sexy way! {???????? maybe sexy is her name, a reference to that show cham fau was lusting over?}{sexy de yuke; maybe it's a "go deal with him" sexual style}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.72,0:10:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:50.60,0:10:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey... Husband! Wake up!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.92,0:10:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something strange with me.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.91,0:11:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I drank that black juice you left.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.87,0:11:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Juice?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.38,0:11:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,From the ampoule, right? {??????? lit: was that everyone? - no clue}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.32,0:11:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you drink it too?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.14,0:11:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:23.13,0:11:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I can't go on anymore...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:27.26,0:11:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Husband, since you've fixed the roof, \Nfix the room too, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:31.39,0:11:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Our kitchen pump is broken too.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.52,0:11:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, the garden needs sweeping.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.28,0:11:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right, the room was full of paper scraps.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.52,0:11:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone will need to feed the chickens too.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:41.96,0:11:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The bath needs to be heated.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.03,0:11:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And I need to fill up the water jug.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.97,0:11:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, I'm so tired \Nand there's so many things to do!
